  <section><div class="grid">
    <article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">Kotlin / Jetpack Compose</span><h2><a href="/projects/productivity-caller/">Productivity Caller</a></h2><p>A native Android reminder application built with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose that uses scheduled phone calls to ensure critical tasks are never missed. Features a pattern-based parser for entering tasks in natural language. Read about the system architecture, background service execution, and user flow.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">Astro / GitHub Actions</span><h2><a href="/projects/sm-dex/">SM'S DEX</a></h2><p>An interactive developer portfolio built with Astro and plain CSS. It features nine faithful device generation themes, extensive accessibility support, and a fully automated public roster system driven by GitHub Actions and issue templates.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">Solidity / MERN</span><h2>Chaincode</h2><p>A web3 coding platform that validates code originality using Gemini AI achieving over 95% accuracy. Validated code submissions are securely minted as non-fungible tokens (NFTs) on the blockchain. <a href="https://github.com/smresponsibilities/Chain-Code">View repository</a>.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="eyebrow">React / WebSockets</span><h2>QuizDeck</h2><p>A highly scalable multiplayer quiz application leveraging React and WebSockets. The system architecture was stress-tested to support up to 500 concurrent players with an average response time of just 31 milliseconds. <a href="https://github.com/smresponsibilities/QuizDeck">View repository</a>.</p></article>
